  "editorialReview": {
    "reviewedAt": "2026-11-01",
    "verdict": "partial: demo only",
    "verified": [
      "500 ms comes from Samsung documentation, as quoted in the IMC 2024 paper; LG documents 10 ms, so \"через полсекунды\" is Samsung-specific.",
      "Fingerprint, content-library matching, ad targeting and HDMI capture are in the IMC 2024 paper."
    ],
    "openClaims": [
      "\"По умолчанию включено\" is not confirmed by a page that was read. The paper only confirms that opting out stops ACR traffic.",
      "Texas suit and Samsung agreement rest on search results and secondary coverage; a person should read the Texas AG release, which refuses automated fetches.",
      "The setting name \"распознавание контента\" varies by brand."
    ]
  },
